TypeShrine_Text_WelcomeToShrine:
    .string "Welcome, young trainer.\p"
    .string "This is the Type Shrine.\n"
    .string "Here, destiny is chosen.$"

TypeShrine_Text_ChooseYourType:
    .string "The type you select will\n"
    .string "define your entire journey.\p"
    .string "Choose wisely - you may\n"
    .string "only choose once.$"

TypeShrine_Text_ConfirmChoice:
    .string "Is this the type you\n"
    .string "wish to walk with?$"

TypeShrine_Text_YouHaveChosen:
    .string "Your type has been chosen.\n"
    .string "May your journey be true.$"

TypeShrine_Text_StarterGiven:
    .string "A partner has chosen you!\n"
    .string "Take good care of them.$"

TypeShrine_Text_YourJourneyBegins:
    .string "Your journey begins now.\p"
    .string "Stay true to your type,\n"
    .string "and you will find your way.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescNormal:
    .string "NORMAL: Adaptable and versatile.\n"
    .string "No weaknesses - but no\p"
    .string "strengths either. A balanced\n"
    .string "path for a clever trainer.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescFighting:
    .string "FIGHTING: Power and discipline.\n"
    .string "Those who choose this type\p"
    .string "never back down from\n"
    .string "a challenge.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescFlying:
    .string "FLYING: Freedom and swiftness.\n"
    .string "Masters of the sky who\p"
    .string "strike from above and\n"
    .string "vanish like the wind.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescPoison:
    .string "POISON: Patient and cunning.\n"
    .string "Victory comes not through\p"
    .string "brute force, but through\n"
    .string "slow, inevitable attrition.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescGround:
    .string "GROUND: Unyielding and solid.\n"
    .string "Rooted in the earth, these\p"
    .string "POKéMON endure where\n"
    .string "others crumble.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescRock:
    .string "ROCK: Ancient and enduring.\n"
    .string "The strongest defenses\p"
    .string "belong to those who\n"
    .string "stand like stone.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescBug:
    .string "BUG: Relentless and numerous.\n"
    .string "Underestimated by many,\p"
    .string "Bug-type trainers always\n"
    .string "have the last laugh.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescGhost:
    .string "GHOST: Mysterious and elusive.\n"
    .string "Those who embrace the\p"
    .string "shadows gain power that\n"
    .string "defies all logic.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescSteel:
    .string "STEEL: Precise and impenetrable.\n"
    .string "No other type can match\p"
    .string "the raw defensive might\n"
    .string "of steel.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescFire:
    .string "FIRE: Fierce and passionate.\n"
    .string "Burn bright and consume\p"
    .string "all that stands in the\n"
    .string "path forward.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescWater:
    .string "WATER: Flowing and adaptive.\n"
    .string "Like a river, Water-type\p"
    .string "trainers find a way\n"
    .string "around every obstacle.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescGrass:
    .string "GRASS: Patient and nurturing.\n"
    .string "Growth takes time, but\p"
    .string "those who tend their\n"
    .string "bonds reap great rewards.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescElectric:
    .string "ELECTRIC: Fast and shocking.\n"
    .string "Strike before the opponent\p"
    .string "can act. Speed is the\n"
    .string "greatest weapon.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescPsychic:
    .string "PSYCHIC: Brilliant and intuitive.\n"
    .string "A Psychic-type trainer\p"
    .string "always sees the next\n"
    .string "move coming.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescIce:
    .string "ICE: Cold and calculating.\n"
    .string "Freeze the opponent's\p"
    .string "strategy before it can\n"
    .string "ever take shape.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescDragon:
    .string "DRAGON: Proud and powerful.\n"
    .string "The rarest bloodline.\p"
    .string "Those who walk this path\n"
    .string "are destined for greatness.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescDark:
    .string "DARK: Cunning and ruthless.\n"
    .string "Victory by any means\p"
    .string "necessary. There are no\n"
    .string "rules in the wild.$"

TypeShrine_Text_DescFairy:
    .string "FAIRY: Gentle yet unyielding.\n"
    .string "A power that transcends\p"
    .string "the physical world. Even\n"
    .string "Dragons bow to Fairy.$"

TypeShrine_Text_PoisonChoose:
    .string "Two POKéMON answer the\n"
    .string "call of Poison.\p"
    .string "Which will be your partner?$"

TypeShrine_Text_FlyingChoose:
    .string "Three POKéMON soar on\n"
    .string "the winds of Flying.\p"
    .string "Which will be your partner?$"

TypeShrine_Text_BugChoose:
    .string "Three POKéMON swarm under\n"
    .string "the banner of Bug.\p"
    .string "Which will be your partner?$"

TypeShrine_Text_RockChoose:
    .string "Three ancient POKéMON\n"
    .string "represent the Rock type.\p"
    .string "Which will be your partner?$"

TypeShrine_Text_FireChoose:
    .string "Three flames burn bright\n"
    .string "for the Fire type.\p"
    .string "Which will be your partner?$"

TypeShrine_Text_WaterChoose:
    .string "Three currents flow for\n"
    .string "the Water type.\p"
    .string "Which will be your partner?$"

TypeShrine_Text_GrassChoose:
    .string "Three seeds grow for\n"
    .string "the Grass type.\p"
    .string "Which will be your partner?$"
